            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0393" n="281" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg281"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/1460</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-29T11:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 29, 1918, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to my despatch of January 24, No. 572.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d312-f1"/>
                    Last evening House of Representatives was enabled to establish a quorum with
                    attendance of total Conservative membership and passed the limited amnesty bill
                    to which the President consents. No Liberals attended. It is believed Senate
                    will pass measure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
